---
layout: base.njk
permalink: "/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ site.name }} — official and off-airport parking when the airport lot is full"
  description: "{{ site.description }}"
  breadcrumbs:
    - name: Home
      url: /
---
<section class="page-hero wrap">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <p class="eyebrow">A public-source directory</p>
  <h1>{{ site.tagline }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ site.description }} We only list hours, shuttle facts, and rates that a public page publishes, and we date every check. If we cannot verify it, it does not go on the page. We do not cache live prices or open spots — reserve on the airport’s or the operator’s own site.</p>
</section>

<section class="wrap" id="airports">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Airports</h2>
    <p class="muted">Each airport is one data file, so a new page can ship as soon as the listings are verified.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="city-grid">
    {% for airport in airports %}
    <li>
      <a class="city-card" href="{{ airport | airportPath }}">
        <h3>{{ airport.airportCode }} — {{ airport.city }}, {{ airport.state }}</h3>
        <p>{{ airport.officialLots | length }} official lots · {{ airport.listings | length }} off-airport listings</p>
        <p class="small muted">Updated {{ airport.lastUpdated | displayDate }}</p>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="wrap tonight">
  <h2>Why this directory exists</h2>
  <p>People looking for airport parking often find that the cheaper official lot is sold out, or that drive-up rates are higher than they planned for. This site is for the other options: official lots and their published rate cards, off-airport shuttle lots, and hotel park-and-fly packages that the operator itself publishes.</p>
  <p><a href="/guides/airport-parking-full-what-to-do-and-where-to-park-instead/">Read the sold-out parking guide</a> · <a href="/about/">How we research listings</a></p>
</section>
